Text in sentences.jsonl in this directory is taken from Polish Wikipedia
(https://pl.wikipedia.org/) and is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Attribution: "Wikipedia contributors". Each line records the article title
(source_title), the article URL (url), the revision id it was taken from
(revision) and a permanent link to that revision (permalink), where the full
list of authors is available in the page history.

Changes: the article text was split into sentences, filtered (short/long
sentences, lists, headings, non-Latin text removed) and normalised to Unicode
NFC. Sentences are otherwise unchanged.

Share-alike: this directory (and only this directory) is CC BY-SA 4.0. Derived
copies of these sentences must be shared under the same license. The rest of
the repository is not affected; keep this data in its own folder.
